<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 5.5 bln levs of 35-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 5.5 bln levs of 35-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed a special issue of 35-day discount T-bills worth 5.5 billion levs ($3.5 million), yielding 22.7 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice, the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issue was placed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Details of issue follow. Prices are in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3019997009</p>
<p> Type			    discount</p>
<p> Term			    35 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    March 4</p>
<p> Maturity date		 April 8</p>
<p> Par value		     5,500 million levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 81.50 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     22.70 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569 ($ = 1565 Bulgarian Levs)</p>
</text>
